{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36614","headline":"广陵秋日酬进士臧濆见寄 · 罗隐","name":"广陵秋日酬进士臧濆见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驿西斜日满窗前，独凭秋栏思渺绵。\n数尺断蓬惭故国，一轮清镜泣流年。\n已知世事真徒尔，纵有心期亦偶然。\n空媿荀家好兄弟，鴈来鱼去是因缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}